### 1. Add Laptop
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 899.99
}

### 2. Add Mouse
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse",
  "price": 24.99
}

### 3. Add Lamp
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lamp",
  "price": 15.50
}

### 4. Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### 5. Get product 1
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

### 6. Delete product 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/1

### 7. Get all again (Laptop should be gone)
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### 8. The 404 experiment (id does not exist)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/99

### 9. Search for Lap
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search?name=Lap

### 10. Search with no match
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search?name=xyz